; NO `environment` HERE. Camera3D.environment OVERRIDES WorldEnvironment
; outright. A placeholder Environment left on this camera meant the game
; rendered with default linear tonemapping at exposure 1.0, no fog and no
; glow, while main.gd dutifully wrote every MOOD value into a
; WorldEnvironment that was never used to draw a single pixel. The ward was
; bright and flat in play no matter what the lighting values said, and every
; tools/shoot.gd still looked correct because that harness builds its own
; WorldEnvironment and has no camera override. Do not reintroduce this.
fov = 72.0
near = 0.05
far = 100.0

